hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"110","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Abi Umar ne hadees bayan ki, kahne lage: Hamein Sufyan bin Uyaynah ne hadees bayan ki, Yazeed bin Khuseifah se, Saa'ib bin Yazeed se, ke Rasoolullah, sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, ke jism par Uhud ke din do zireh theen, jin ke darmiyan zahar ki gayi thi."
"111","[AI-translation] Hamein Qutaybah bin Saeed ne hadees bayan ki, kahne lage: Hamein Malik bin Anas ne hadees bayan ki, Ibn Shihab se, Anas bin Malik se: Ke Nabi, sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, Makkah mein dakhil hue aur un par maghfar tha, to unse kaha gaya: Yeh Ibn Khatal Ka'bah ke pardo se lataka hua hai, to aap ne farmaya: Isay qatal karo."
"112","[AI-translation] Hamein Eesa bin Ahmed ne hadees bayan ki, kahne lage: Hamein Abdullah bin Wahb ne hadees bayan ki, kahne lage: Mujhe Malik bin Anas ne hadees bayan ki, Ibn Shihab se, Anas bin Malik se, ke Rasoolullah, sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, Fateh ke saal Makkah mein dakhil hue, aur un ke sir par maghfar tha, farmaya: Jab unhone usay utara to ek shakhs un ke paas aaya, aur unse kaha: Ibn Khatal Ka'bah ke pardo se lataka hua hai, to aap ne farmaya: Isay qatal karo. Ibn Shihab ne kaha: Aur mujhe pahuncha hai ke Rasoolullah, sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, us waqt muhrim nahi the."
"113","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Bashaar ne hadees bayan ki, kahne lage: Hamein Abdur Rahman bin Mehdi ne hadees bayan ki, Hammad bin Salamah se (h) Hamein Mahmood bin Ghaylaan ne hadees bayan ki, kahne lage: Hamein Waki' ne hadees bayan ki, Hammad bin Salamah se, Abuz-Zubair se, Jaaber se, kahne lage: Nabi, sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, Fateh ke din Makkah mein dakhil hue, aur un par siyah (kali) imaamah thi."
"114","[AI-translation] Hamein Ibn Abi Umar ne hadees bayan ki, kahne lage: Hamein Sufyan ne hadees bayan ki, Musawir al-Warraq se, Ja'far bin Amr bin Hureith se, un ke waalid se, kahne lage: Maine Nabi, sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, ko minbar par khutbah dete huye dekha, aur un par siyah (kali) imaamah thi."
